            <div xml:id="d164-a1">

                <pb facs="d164-01" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76ve05p1/d164-01"/>


                <head>Note</head>
                <dateline><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date when="1970-01-15">January 15,
                        1970</date></dateline>
                <pb facs="d164-02" n="2" xml:id="d164-02"/>
                <p>Per Roger Morris:</p>
                <p>
                    Richardson said we would prefer to have
                    the Princess see Deputy Assistant Moore
                    over here on the grounds that she would still be seen by an authoritative
                    official but would not be as conspicuous and would not get us in trouble with
                    the Federals. She has been making some rather serious charges.</p>
                <p>Question is who calls Galbraith? Richardson or Kissinger?</p>
            </div>
        </body>
